    Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0 with source attribution and share-alike.
  - Transit operators, terrain, basemaps, satellite imagery and other live
    sources: their individual attribution, access and redistribution terms.

Native engine/component licenses are retained in their sources/resources and
in SCENE-NOTICES.txt inside the generated app. Optional SNAP, Python packages
and detector models retain their own licenses. The project's MIT grant does
not supersede those terms. See DATA_SOURCES.md, NOTICE.md and the resource
READMEs for details.
